 [def [option -histDayVar]]
 
 Return the name of the daily histogram array variable.
 
+[def [option -maxPerMinute]]
+
+Return the maximum rate per second observed over a minute.
+Only supported for [option -timehist] counters.
+
+[def [option -maxPerHour]]
+
+Return the maximum rate per second observed over an hour.
+Only supported for [option -timehist] counters.
+
+[def [option -maxPerDay]]
+
+Return the maximum rate per second observed over a day.
+Only supported for [option -timehist] counters.
+
 [def [option -resetDate]]
 
 Return the clock seconds value recorded when the
 counter was last reset.
 

